1. Brainstorming

The brainstorming phase focuses on generating ideas to solve the problem of poor money management among students, employees, and young adults.

Problems Identified
Difficulty tracking daily expenses
Overspending on food, shopping, entertainment, and subscriptions
Lack of proper monthly budgeting
Difficulty identifying unnecessary expenses
Low awareness of saving opportunities
Manual expense tracking can be time-consuming
Users may not know how much they can safely spend
Existing budgeting apps may provide data without personalized recommendations
